[{"_1":2},"llms/index",{"_3":4},"data","# Docs\n\n- [PoliNetwork's Technical Documentation](/docs/intro)\n- Infrastructure\n  - [Intro](/docs/infrastructure/Introduction)\n  - Getting Started\n    - [Setup](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/setup)\n    - Cloud Infrastructure\n      - [Cloud Infrastructure](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/cloud-infrastructure)\n      - [Terraform](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/cloud-infrastructure/terraform): Detailed overview of our Azure-based infrastructure managed via the polinetworkorg/terraform repository.\n      - [K3s Node](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/cloud-infrastructure/k3s-node): The k3s01 VM, how Ansible configures it, and how to run the playbooks.\n      - [Flux](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/cloud-infrastructure/flux): How Flux deploys the polinetwork-cd repository to the K3s cluster.\n    - Pipelines\n      - [CI](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/pipelines/ci)\n      - [CD](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/pipelines/cd)\n    - K8s Basics\n      - [Intro](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/k8s-basics/intro)\n      - Day-to-day\n        - [Monitoring](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/k8s-basics/day-to-day/monitoring)\n        - [SSH](/docs/infrastructure/getting-started/k8s-basics/day-to-day/ssh)\n  - Guides\n    - [Add a New Secret](/docs/infrastructure/Guides/add-a-new-secret)\n    - [Add Storage](/docs/infrastructure/Guides/add-storage)\n    - [Backups](/docs/infrastructure/Guides/backups)\n    - [Deploy a New App](/docs/infrastructure/Guides/deploy-a-new-app)\n- Archived Projects 🗃️\n  - [Archived Projects 🗃️](/docs/archive): Collection of documentations for archived projects and repositories.\n  - PoliFemo\n    - [PoliFemo](/docs/archive/app)\n    - [emoji](/docs/archive/app/emoji)\n    - [Features App (in ordine di priorita')](/docs/archive/app/features)\n    - Design\n      - [emoji](/docs/archive/app/design/emoji)\n      - [schermate](/docs/archive/app/design/schermate)\n      - Calendario\n        - [caratteristiche](/docs/archive/app/design/calendario/caratteristiche)\n        - [sincronizzazione](/docs/archive/app/design/calendario/sincronizzazione)\n      - Home\n        - [caratteristiche](/docs/archive/app/design/home/caratteristiche)\n      - Palette\n        - [darkmode](/docs/archive/app/design/palette/darkmode)\n        - [lightmode](/docs/archive/app/design/palette/lightmode)\n    - Developer\n      - [roles](/docs/archive/app/developer/developer-info)\n      - [diagrams](/docs/archive/app/developer/mermaid)\n      - Backend\n        - [Prima installazione su server](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/runOnServer)\n        - [ToDo Backend](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/todo_backend)\n        - DBPolifemo\n          - [TabellaGroups](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/DBPolifemo/TabellaGroups)\n          - [TabelleArticle](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/DBPolifemo/TabelleArticle)\n          - [TabelleCalendar](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/DBPolifemo/TabelleCalendar)\n          - Old\n            - [inserisci.py](/docs/archive/app/developer/backend/DBPolifemo/old/inserisci.py)\n      - Data structures\n        - [articles](/docs/archive/app/developer/data-structures/articles)\n      - Frontend\n        - [Convenzioni](/docs/archive/app/developer/frontend/conventions)\n        - [Components](/docs/archive/app/developer/frontend/usefulComponents)"]
